# prompt: short cloth rustle
# tags: cloth, rustle, fabric, foley
# The attack is the whole design: fabric has no transient, so an envelope that
# opens over 20 ms is what stops this reading as a burst of hiss. The grain
# layer is the individual fibres letting go.
sound "cloth rustle" 300ms foley
  rustle: noise pink >> bp ~3200Hz[1500..7000] Q1 | gain 0.46 attack 20ms decay 240ms
  fibre: grains ~4200Hz[2000..9000] rate ~200[80..500] width 2ms spread 2 bend 1 | gain 0.24 attack 15ms decay 200ms delay 30ms
